## Príkazy

Agent nemá TTY → nikdy `docker exec -it` (padne na „the input device is not a TTY").

```bash
{{run}}php bin/console cache:clear
{{run}}php bin/console doctrine:migrations:migrate --no-interaction
{{run}}php bin/console debug:router            # routy; debug:container <id>, debug:autowiring <typ>
{{run}}php bin/console importmap:install       # stiahne assets/vendor/ po čerstvom klone
```

### Overenie — zdravý výstup

Hotovo = príkaz prebehol a výstup to dokazuje. PASS nikdy nehlás bez výstupu.

| Príkaz | Zdravý výstup |
|---|---|
| `/dev:check` · `/dev:check --full` | `[dev-kit] check quick: PASS · …` |
| `{{run}}php vendor/bin/phpunit` | `OK (… tests, … assertions)` |
| `{{run}}php vendor/bin/phpstan analyse -c {{phpstanConfig}}` | `[OK] No errors` |
| `{{run}}php bin/console lint:container` | `[OK] The container was linted successfully: …` |
| `{{run}}php bin/console lint:yaml config --parse-tags` | `[OK] All … YAML files contain valid syntax.` |
| `{{run}}php bin/console lint:twig templates` | `[OK] All … Twig files contain valid syntax.` |
| `{{run}}php bin/console doctrine:schema:validate` | `[OK] The mapping files are correct.` + `… in sync with the mapping files.` |

Počty testov ani časy sem nepíš — zastarávajú; `/dev:review` hlási zastaraný CLAUDE.md a rules.

## Architektúra

- `src/Controller/` — tenké controllery (`#[Route]`), logika v `src/Service/`
- `src/Entity/` + `src/Repository/` — Doctrine mapovanie atribútmi, dotazy len v repozitároch
- `src/ApiResource/`, `src/State/` — API Platform zdroje, providery a processory
- `src/Command/` — CLI a cron príkazy (`#[AsCommand]`)
- `src/EventSubscriber/`, `src/Security/` — listenery, votery, autentifikácia
- `config/` — `services.yaml` (autowire + autoconfigure), `packages/*.yaml`, `routes/`
- `templates/` (Twig) · `assets/` (AssetMapper, `importmap.php`) · `translations/`
- `migrations/` (Doctrine migrácie) · `tests/` (PHPUnit, zrkadlí `src/`)
